### 1. Register an Employer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TechCorp HR",
  "email": "hr@techcorp.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "employer"
}

### 2. Register an Applicant
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Khan",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "applicant"
}

### 3. Login as Employer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hr@techcorp.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Create a Job (Must run Login first to get the cookie!)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "MERN Stack Developer",
  "description": "Looking for a junior developer with React and Node experience.",
  "company": "TechCorp",
  "location": "Remote",
  "salary": "$800/month"
}

### 5. Get All Jobs (Public route)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs